},"79":{"id":"/docs/add-a-project-77","page_id":"/docs/add-a-project","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/add-a-project#rules","content":"**Shared / external / contribute-only repos (🤝, e.g. `AleannLab/draw`):** registry + vault note + learnings catalog are OK (Jackie-OS side only). **Never** write a bridge/`docs/solutions/`/CLAUDE.md into the repo, never push/PR to it, never add it to `merge_poll.py`. Sync is read-only via morning-brief."},"80":{"id":"/docs/architecture","page_id":"/docs/architecture","type":"page","content":"Ecosystem Architecture","breadcrumbs":["Docs","What is this system?"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/architecture"},"81":{"id":"/docs/architecture-0","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture","content":"One-screen map of three systems, shared rails, and how Hermes ties them together."},"82":{"id":"/docs/architecture-1","page_id":"/docs/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"1\\. Jackie-OS — the AI operating system"},"83":{"id":"/docs/architecture-2","page_id":"/docs/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/architecture#roles","content":"Roles"},"84":{"id":"/docs/architecture-3","page_id":"/docs/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/architecture#automation-reality-2026-07-10","content":"Automation reality (2026-07-10)"},"85":{"id":"/docs/architecture-4","page_id":"/docs/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/architecture#1b-llm-gateway--live-profiles-as-of-2026-08-17","content":"1b. LLM Gateway — live profiles (as of 2026-08-17)"},"86":{"id":"/docs/architecture-5","page_id":"/docs/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/architecture#2-newfin--net-worth--trading-desk-devnewfin","content":"2\\. Newfin — net-worth + trading desk (`~/dev/newfin`)"},"87":{"id":"/docs/architecture-6","page_id":"/docs/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/architecture#3-rodyna--family-recipes-devrodyna","content":"3\\. Rodyna — family recipes (`~/dev/rodyna`)"},"88":{"id":"/docs/architecture-7","page_id":"/docs/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/architecture#4-draw--tennis-community-platform-devdraw","content":"4\\. Draw — tennis community platform (`~/dev/draw`)"},"89":{"id":"/docs/architecture-8","page_id":"/docs/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/architecture#4b-b-unit--habit--quest-app-devbunit--projectsb-unit","content":"4b. B-Unit — habit + quest app (`~/dev/bunit` + `Projects/B-Unit/`)"},"90":{"id":"/docs/architecture-9","page_id":"/docs/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/architecture#5-shared-rails--same-infra-different-products","content":"5\\. Shared rails — same infra, different products"},"91":{"id":"/docs/architecture-10","page_id":"/docs/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/architecture#pointers","content":"Pointers"},"92":{"id":"/docs/architecture-11","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture","content":"**One operator, three systems, one spine.** Jackie-OS is the always-on AI operating layer; Newfin and Rodyna are independent product repos that ride the same shared rails. The spine is **Hermes** (the VPS gateway): the single LLM gateway, the cron host, and the SSH bridge into Newfin."},"93":{"id":"/docs/architecture-12","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture","content":"> **Quick rule for agents:** code lives in `~/dev/{newfin,rodyna,draw}` (CTO territory). *Knowledge about* the code lives in the vault (`Vault/Newfin.md`, `Vault/Rodyna.md`). Technical fix write-ups live in each repo's `docs/solutions/`. Don't confuse the two."},"94":{"id":"/docs/architecture-13","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture","content":"Solid = data/control flow · dotted `knowledge about` = vault notes, not code · Newfin & Rodyna would run without Jackie-OS; Hermes is what makes it one OS."},"95":{"id":"/docs/architecture-14","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"Sergei's always-on OS. The **vault is memory**, **skills are the contract**, **scripts are dumb runners**, **Hermes is the 24/7 instance** on a VPS. &#x2A;*Operator desk:** Cursor + Tailscale + Hermes + Grokbot — Operator desk. History: Desk journey. Tool-agnostic: any agent that opens `~/Jackie-OS` and reads `CLAUDE.md` *becomes* an instance. Hosts four code repos (Newfin, Rodyna, Draw, B-Unit) and multiple products/projects (B-Unit, Peaches Beauty, Nastusha), all synced to the vault via `project-sync`."},"96":{"id":"/docs/architecture-15","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"**Stack:** Obsidian (markdown) · bash/Python runners · Claude Agent SDK · VPS cron (Europe/Warsaw) · git + symlink farm · Telegram Bot API."},"97":{"id":"/docs/architecture-16","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"**Layers:**"},"98":{"id":"/docs/architecture-17","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"**Vault** (`Vault/`) — journals, project notes, briefs, coaching corpus, ops board, `Agent-Learnings/` index. Source of truth."},"99":{"id":"/docs/architecture-18","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"**Skills** (`System/skills/`) — markdown agent specs (morning-brief, project-sync, research, wrap-up, coaching, …)."},"100":{"id":"/docs/architecture-19","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"**Scripts** (`System/{coo,capture,ops,periodic,work,lib}/`) — edited in repo, run on VPS via a **symlink farm** (`~/.hermes/scripts/&#60;name>` → repo). Repo is the source of truth; never edit the VPS copy."},"101":{"id":"/docs/architecture-20","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"**Script groups by function:**"},"102":{"id":"/docs/architecture-21","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"`coo/` — COO ops (brief delivery, Telegram integration, vault index updates)"},"103":{"id":"/docs/architecture-22","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"`capture/` — journal capture, Telegram sweep, trade digest, meeting capture"},"104":{"id":"/docs/architecture-23","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"`ops/` — VPS service health, Hermes ops proxy, code exec gate, notify endpoint"},"105":{"id":"/docs/architecture-24","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"`periodic/` — intel weekly, codebase index (`cbm`), janitor maintenance"},"106":{"id":"/docs/architecture-25","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"`work/` — ad-hoc agent work (code ask, wrap-up ops)"},"107":{"id":"/docs/architecture-26","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"`lib/` — shared utilities (env loader, logging helpers)"},"108":{"id":"/docs/architecture-27","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"**Secrets** (`.secrets/*.env`) — gitignored, mode 0600."},"109":{"id":"/docs/architecture-28","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"**Hermes VPS** (Hetzner cx23; Tailscale `hermes-phase1`) — one Agent SDK instance as the `hermes` user; **one LLM gateway** for all calls (failover chain). Dashboard `:9119`, Headroom `:8787`, AgentsView `:8081`."},"110":{"id":"/docs/architecture-29","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"**Operator desk:** Cursor + Tailscale + Hermes + Grokbot. bb is not in active use."},"111":{"id":"/docs/architecture-30","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#roles","content":"Claude takes a functional role per task. Each role defines what to read and produce:"},"112":{"id":"/docs/architecture-31","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#roles","content":"Role"},"113":{"id":"/docs/architecture-32","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#roles","content":"What it does"},"114":{"id":"/docs/architecture-33","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#roles","content":"**COO** (default)"},"115":{"id":"/docs/architecture-34","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#roles","content":"Personal assistant / PM. Daily briefs, task lists, project status, calendar, ops board."},"116":{"id":"/docs/architecture-35","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#roles","content":"**CPO**"},"117":{"id":"/docs/architecture-36","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#roles","content":"Planning, feature scoping, roadmap work on project notes."},"118":{"id":"/docs/architecture-37","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#roles","content":"**CMO**"},"1